  (text "USB-C / PD\n- U202 STUSB4500: NVM PDO3 = 15V/1.5A, PDO2 = 12V/1.5A, PDO1 = 5V. VBUS_EN_SNK drives load switch Q201.\n- VSYS grounded (unused). DISCH and VBUS_VS_DISCH have current-limiting resistors.\n- U201 ESD protection on D+/D-/CC1/CC2. Shield to chassis through 1M || 4.7n."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "f5db0849-2ab9-5863-b3f7-139942e2d609")
  )
